  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Logistic Strategic Conference Netherlands Commission for Environmental Assessment (MER)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To mitigate the potential environmental effects of the exploitation of oil and gas findings in Senegal, the Netherlands embassy in Dakar, on behalf of the Netherlands Commission for Environmental Assessment (MER), has offered to the Government of Senegal the organisation of a strategic conference to discuss how Strategic Environmental Assessment might facilitate the sustainable development of the oil and gas sector of Senegal convening in September 2017. The Strategic Environmental Assessment aims to enhance the transparency and inclusiveness of strategic planning and decision-making processes. The assessment aims to consider all impacts on sustainable development. To achieve this objective, all stakeholders, including the relevant ministers, will participate in a high-level conference. Based on the conference outcomes, an evaluation of environmental programs will be developed.</narrative>
  </description>
